    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "textbook-why-compatible",
        "moduleId": "m-problem",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "教材：数值类型看似都赋值兼容",
        "markdown": "教材从自然的直觉出发：所有数值类型变量的值都是数，因此似乎没有理由不把它们统统声明为赋值兼容。\n\n例如把整数 3 赋给实数变量，数学上仍表示同一个数，仅看“值”的层面没有明显矛盾。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-babef9366a304ec14e46e038",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000061"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "13. Elementary Data Types",
                "Compatibility between numeric data types"
              ],
              "lineStart": 514,
              "lineEnd": 520,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "52d41f7db98d791d7c380143e9aea5ae0ad3091171d9282c3b7d68e98d4d2d88"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-numeric-notion-limit",
        "moduleId": "m-problem",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "模型补充：只看到“值”会漏掉表示与精度",
        "markdown": "这个直觉忽略了类型除“值”之外还携带表示与精度约定：整数承诺精确计算，实数只保证有限精度。赋值是否兼容，最终取决于两种表示能否在可接受代价下互换，而不是取决于两者都是数。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-why-compatible"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-representation-clash",
        "moduleId": "m-representation",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "教材：不同数值类型用不同位序列表示",
        "markdown": "教材随即指出关键差异：不同类型的数在计算机内部用不同位序列表示。每当把类型 T0 的数赋给类型 T1 的变量时，都必须执行一次表示转换；转换耗时很少，但它确实存在。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-babef9366a304ec14e46e038",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000061"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "13. Elementary Data Types",
                "Compatibility between numeric data types"
              ],
              "lineStart": 514,
              "lineEnd": 520,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "52d41f7db98d791d7c380143e9aea5ae0ad3091171d9282c3b7d68e98d4d2d88"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-bit-reencoding",
        "moduleId": "m-representation",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "模型补充：转换是在重新编码",
        "markdown": "以常见实现为例，INTEGER 使用定长二进制位模式，REAL 把字拆成符号、指数和尾数三段。把整数放进实数变量不是复制位，而是重新编码成浮点格式；反向转换还要处理取整与取值范围。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-representation-clash"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-hidden-or-explicit",
        "moduleId": "m-policy",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "comparison",
        "title": "教材：隐藏转换还是显式声明不兼容",
        "markdown": "教材把设计选择摆成两种立场：把转换隐藏起来以避免分散注意力，或让转换显式可见因为它影响程序效率。\n\n教材选择后者：把不同数值类型声明为不兼容，并提供显式的、预定义的转换函数。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-babef9366a304ec14e46e038",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000061"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "13. Elementary Data Types",
                "Compatibility between numeric data types"
              ],
              "lineStart": 514,
              "lineEnd": 520,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "52d41f7db98d791d7c380143e9aea5ae0ad3091171d9282c3b7d68e98d4d2d88"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-implicit-vs-explicit-cost",
        "moduleId": "m-policy",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "comparison",
        "title": "模型补充：隐式与显式各自的代价",
        "markdown": "隐式转换让源码更短，但转换被藏进看不见的指令里，也容易掩盖精度损失；显式转换要求写出转换函数，代码更啰嗦，却能一眼看出哪里发生了表示变化、哪里可能损失精度。教材的选择是让代价可见。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-hidden-or-explicit"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-conversion-instructions",
        "moduleId": "m-mechanism",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "教材：机器与语言都需要转换指令",
        "markdown": "为了完整，计算机指令集必须包含转换指令，既能将整数转换为浮点数，也能将浮点数转换为整数。\n\n同样的要求在语言层面成立：语言需要提供对应的转换手段，而不是依赖程序员手写位操作。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-babef9366a304ec14e46e038",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000061"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "13. Elementary Data Types",
                "Compatibility between numeric data types"
              ],
              "lineStart": 514,
              "lineEnd": 520,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "52d41f7db98d791d7c380143e9aea5ae0ad3091171d9282c3b7d68e98d4d2d88"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-conversion-instruction-cost",
        "moduleId": "m-mechanism",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "模型补充：单次很便宜，循环里会累积",
        "markdown": "一次显式转换最终会落实为一条或几条机器指令。单次开销很小，但如果它出现在循环体内，累积成本就会显现；把转换写在源码里，正好让这类成本可以被审视和优化。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-conversion-instructions"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-oberon-types",
        "moduleId": "m-boundary",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "教材：Oberon 的数值类型与转换函数",
        "markdown": "在（修订）Oberon 中，算术数据类型只有 INTEGER、REAL、BYTE，可能还有 LONGREAL。\n\n教材列出两个转换函数，其中 FLOOR(x) 给出不大于 x 的最大整数，用于把实数转换为整数。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-babef9366a304ec14e46e038",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000061"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "13. Elementary Data Types",
                "Compatibility between numeric data types"
              ],
              "lineStart": 514,
              "lineEnd": 520,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "52d41f7db98d791d7c380143e9aea5ae0ad3091171d9282c3b7d68e98d4d2d88"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-floor-example",
        "moduleId": "m-boundary",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "example",
        "title": "模型补充：FLOOR 的取整方向",
        "markdown": "教材在练习中提到另一方向的转换函数 FLT(i)，它把整数转换为实数。FLOOR 则向负无穷取整：FLOOR(2.7) = 2，FLOOR(-2.3) = -3；若误以为它总是截断小数部分，就会在负数上得到错误结果。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-oberon-types"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-byte-boundary",
        "moduleId": "m-boundary",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "warning",
        "title": "教材：BYTE 是子界，赋值可能溢出",
        "markdown": "BYTE 是 INTEGER 的子界，取值范围为 0 .. 255，因此不需要专门的转换函数。\n\n但给 BYTE 变量赋值可能引起溢出。通常算术运算在 INTEGER 值上进行，编译器把 BYTE 变量按形式 Int 处理。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-babef9366a304ec14e46e038",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000061"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "13. Elementary Data Types",
                "Compatibility between numeric data types"
              ],
              "lineStart": 514,
              "lineEnd": 520,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "52d41f7db98d791d7c380143e9aea5ae0ad3091171d9282c3b7d68e98d4d2d88"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-boundary-check",
        "moduleId": "m-boundary",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "warning",
        "title": "模型补充：兼容不等于安全",
        "markdown": "BYTE 与 INTEGER 共享整数表示，转换不是问题，真正的风险在赋值点的范围检查。若缺少检查，超出 0 .. 255 的值会被截断或回绕，程序继续运行却给出错误数据；因此子界赋值的检查应放在赋值处，而不是交给表示转换。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-byte-boundary"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-transfer-exercise",
        "moduleId": "m-transfer",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "exercise",
        "title": "模型补充：迁移判断",
        "markdown": "情境：某循环把累计和存入 INTEGER 变量，最后赋给 REAL 变量输出；另一个分支把同一累计和赋给 BYTE 变量。\n\n请判断哪些位置需要显式转换、哪些位置需要范围检查，并说明若把全部转换改成隐式会发生什么。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-hidden-or-explicit",
            "textbook-byte-boundary"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-check-summary",
        "moduleId": "m-transfer",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "summary",
        "title": "模型补充：三步判断链",
        "markdown": "本点的判断可压缩为三步：先问两种类型的位表示是否相同，不同则需要表示转换；再问转换是否应显式，教材的选择是显式，以暴露效率与精度代价；最后问目标类型是否有范围限制，如 BYTE 的 0 .. 255，此时真正的风险是溢出而不是位重排。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-representation-clash",
            "textbook-hidden-or-explicit",
            "textbook-byte-boundary"
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
